WEBVTT

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.650
You told me that you finally
found where you belong.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.860
I don't even know when it started.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:23.360
Ever since I can remember,
we were always together.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.360
Your hand always held mine,
no matter what we faced.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:37.570
Thinking back on it now, your hand
wasn't that much bigger than mine.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:43.150
But the warmth of your hand helped
me confirm my own existence.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.400
It was where I belonged.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.030
But...

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.610
After we started living at the old man's house,

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.360
you told me this after discovering
extension technology.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:59.650
To those who have lost
valuable things in their life,

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:04.610
I might be able to use this technology to
give back something even more valuable.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:09.730
Someone like me.
I finally found where I belong, Mary.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:15.780
Your eyes were so beautiful as you gazed
into the distance saying those words...

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:22.320
I wasn't able to say, "The place I
belong is right next to you, Victor."

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:29.980
When you left me behind and
joined the war, I was very uneasy.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.110
At the same time, I was so proud of you.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:42.980
If I could meet you again,
I wanted to say one thing...

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:50.400
I've become a full-fledged engineer
and found my own place to belong.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.400
But...

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.980
A Place to Call Home

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.690
That skill that Victor uses...

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.400
It has to be a huge strain on the sub-brain.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:56.530
He shouldn't be able to use it in quick
succession without sedatives.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:04:03.610
If that's the case, I don't think Juzo
would lose to Victor, even with one arm.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.860
But...

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:10.650
As an old friend, let me
tell you one thing, Juzo.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.980
You shouldn't hold back if
you want to take me down.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.070
You're pretty cheeky.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.480
Do you really understand
that I'm a Gun Slave Unit?

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:28.530
Of course I do.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.110
I'm your personal engineer.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:35.110
You're the one who doesn't understand.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:41.400
Just how many Extendeds do
you think I've slaughtered?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.070
That's true...

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.860
What the hell are these?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.730
Remote control?!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:15.400
Juzo! Victor's comrades must be hiding nearby!

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.230
They're the ones controlling those Extendeds!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:23.030
That's not <i>quite</i> right.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.150
Did you know?

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:30.780
Curiously, Extendeds stuffed into a body
without a head often lose their free will.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:37.440
So now they're puppets that
just follow my orders now.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.530
Puppets?!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.730
Funke Faust!

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:59.400
Quit joking around.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.530
True. That was rude of me.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.940
You'd never be able to go
all out on puppets like these.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.820
Juzo, get back!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.610
Bastard, what the hell did you do?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.480
Did you forget? My other name...

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.730
The Dismantler, huh?

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.570
That's right.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.940
As long as they are in my reach...

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:44.980
...I can take apart any Extended
instantly with these hands!

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.440
You bastards!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:04.860
How far do I have to strip you
down to see your true form?

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:12.480
Juzo!

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.400
It's no use...

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:24.070
...even if you block your pain sensors.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:27.440
Shall I remind you, then?

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:31.980
Even though enemies and allies
alike feared you during the war,

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:36.570
the reason you always hesitated
to flaunt your power...

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:39.030
Victor... You bastard!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:46.980
Among the 13 Gun Slave Units,
only you were given the role.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.570
Verrat Dreizehn.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.690
The brethren slayer, Device 13!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.440
The anecdotes of you are stained in blood!

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.780
Brethren killer?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:08.610
No matter how long it has been since
the war, those events have shackled you.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.940
Well, that's a problem for me.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.070
All of your outer layers...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.650
I'll strip them down!

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:43.320
Where is the Victor I know?

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.780
Victor!

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.570
That's enough already!

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.650
Boob rockets...

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.690
...launch!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.030
Funke Faust!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:21.940
I'm a bit reluctant, but it looks like
I don't have any more hands to play!

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.110
Impossible!

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:30.030
You sacrificed your right arm
to steal away my own arms?!

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:42.150
Whether the Victor I knew was the real Victor...

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:45.570
...or the Victor in front of me.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.480
I just don't know...

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:55.190
But to stop you from hurting any more people...

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.690
At least, with my own hands...

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.780
You're always so reckless.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:29.110
Just because you can block your pain sensors!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.440
Mary, you...

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.860
It...

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.190
It was the right thing to do.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:44.150
That's right.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:50.690
You have no reason to blame yourself, Mary.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.610
Lefty?! You're okay!

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:54.570
Yes.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:11:02.030
Since <i>that body</i> is unconscious, I was able
to allocate more of my sub-brain here.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:08.530
I'm able to communicate using
this voice box because of that.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:13.400
Bastard. Hurry up and tell us who you are.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:17.070
Juzo, you have my thanks.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:22.570
As promised, you've been protecting
Mary in my place this whole time.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:23.530
Huh?!

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.230
You're...

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.780
V-Victor?!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.230
That's right.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.690
I'm the <i>real</i> Victor.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.320
Huh?! But then...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:40.400
That body was just a puppet
for the <i>other</i> Victor.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.280
Tell us the details.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.690
Sorry, I'm going to borrow your body a bit.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:02.030
Let's put aside whether we
can trust you or not for now.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:07.280
If you're the "real" Victor,
who the hell was that?

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:11.320
It's just as I said before.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.780
That was just a puppet.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:18.190
And the one controlling that
puppet is my shadow.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.480
Victor's shadow?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.400
That's hot.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.610
Juzo.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:29.110
I want you to destroy the
shadow that I have created.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.820
Let's see...

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:38.820
It was back when I was your personal engineer.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:44.110
As you know, I joined the
military as an engineer.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:48.440
Because of that, I was sent to a research
facility far from the front lines.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.570
I thought that my research
results would save the soldiers.

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:59.650
Working toward winning the war
was a very worthwhile job.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:06.280
I never doubted the fact that extension
technology would help the people.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:13.900
Eventually, in order to get around the
Limitation of Drone Weaponry Treaty,

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:21.320
we worked day and night to make
remote extension control a reality.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.150
If we could make remote control a reality,

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:29.280
the soldiers wouldn't have to be
exposed to unnecessary danger.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:39.480
However, to do that, we had to deal with
the intense feedback from the remote body.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.440
Resonance.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.780
Just like the boy.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:54.900
Pain is an important source of
information when controlling a body.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:14:00.730
If we just shut down the sense of pain,
there was a huge drop in systemic control.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:06.690
However, the sub-brain technology
that could handle the input and output

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:12.690
of that much information had just been
invented and was still lacking...

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:19.190
It was then that I suggested
the parallel sub-brain system.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:23.780
We used two sub-brains to simulate
the left and right side of the brain.

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:29.110
I had succeeded in increasing the
amount of sheer processing power.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:31.610
Parallel sub-brains?

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.280
I don't think it was ever
released to the public.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:39.940
It was top-secret military research and
has already been scrapped as a failure.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.190
In other words, there was a flaw.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:49.280
If it had succeeded, the problem with
remote resonance would have been solved.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.730
That's right, Mary.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.860
I used myself as a test subject.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:06.030
After many trials, we did our
first test on the front lines.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:13.730
That's when I saw it through the
eyes of my remote extension.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.780
The results of my research.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.190
Stop it!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:06.690
It should have been research
to save the people...

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:17.570
But not a single soul was
saved on that battlefield.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:23.190
Just what have I been doing until now?

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:31.320
When I opened my eyes after the shock
that seemed to crush my heart...

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:39.030
...all I saw was the research facility and my
fellow engineers burning to the ground.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:50.730
Along with someone who looked
like me that wasn't me.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.360
What does that mean?!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.610
Did you do it while you were unconscious?!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.030
Just like it sounds,

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:05.860
you know that a sub-brain is a program
used to help control an Extended, right?

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:15.070
Those sub-brains are often affected by
the thought process routines of the user.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:17.030
No way...

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:23.320
My sub-brain decided to use those routines
to move autonomously as Victor,

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.820
controlling my body.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:32.980
It took over since my own brain had been
shocked from the scene of war.

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:37.900
No way. I can't believe that a sub-brain
would move on its own...

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:42.320
I know that it's hard to believe.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.940
However, I'm sure that he is moving

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:49.070
in accordance with my thought
processes at the time.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:55.780
Extension technology should
not exist in this world.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.980
That's what he believes.

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.650
That is why he believes that his sin

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:07.980
is the development of extension technology
and bringing Extendeds into this world.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.900
He's trying to atone by
destroying all of the Extendeds.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:19.360
B-But it seemed like he was trying to look
inside of Juzo more than destroy him.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:26.030
Well, I'm sure he also holds a lot of
interest in the extension technology.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.650
Juzo.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.780
The hostility he showed you is real.

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:37.280
Once he gets a clear look
inside of you, he will kill you.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:42.570
Then, the reason that Victor is
working with Spitzbergen...

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:46.530
Their aim to destroy all Extendeds
match up with his goal.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.400
I don't really get it.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:55.530
But long story short, your body has
been taken over by your sub-brain?

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.190
Well, that's about it.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.900
I'm not comfortable about this.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:08.150
So that means...

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:16.530
...the fake Victor I had been fighting was
controlled by your parallel sub-brain.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.940
That's right.

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:24.610
And, you're controlling that hand
extension remotely from somewhere.

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:27.860
Well. To summarize, yes.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:31.860
Why are you doing something that troublesome?

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:36.280
Then, where is your real body
with the sub-brain?

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.190
I'm sure you'll find out soon enough.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.320
And when you do, Juzo,

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:51.570
please destroy the parallel
sub-brain installed on my body.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:52.780
Huh?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.280
What do you mean by that?

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:06.780
It's true that I felt despair
on that battlefield.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.610
Everything I believed in crumbled away.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:16.030
But I don't wish for all
Extendeds to disappear.

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:21.110
There are facets of extension technology
that can definitely help people.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.320
So please, Juzo...

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:29.400
Victor?!

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.190
His consciousness is returning...

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:40.780
It looks like our conversation
is reaching its limit.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:43.360
No way...

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:50.070
I'm sure he still has a puppet somewhere...

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:55.230
Sorry, but I'm sick of doing jobs for free.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:57.480
Juzo...

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:02.110
I'll be sure to get my pay from you.
Including the first job.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.480
You better prepare yourself.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:13.610
Juzo, I'm sorry...

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:33.570
Juzo!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:44.190
Sorry, but I can't have you
taking care of Victor's real body.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:49.190
In accordance with the law,
I will take it into custody.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:54.820
Me, Avi Cobo, as the upholder of the law!

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:31.150
Stopping that is the job
of a personal engineer.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:31.150
Why did you leave me behind?!

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:32.730
The other Victor, I presume?

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:34.440
What in the world are you thinking?

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:34.440
That joke ain't funny.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:35.480
Victor...

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:41.440
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 16.
"Engineer."
